graph TD
    A[ER Stress] --> B[Unfolded Protein Accumulation]
    B --> C[IRE1 Activation]
    C --> D[HAC1 mRNA Splicing]
    D --> E[HAC1 Translation]
    E --> F[Hac1 Transcription Factor]
    F --> G[UPR Gene Transcription]
    G --> H[ER Chaperone Synthesis]
    H --> I[Protein Folding Assistance]
    I --> J[UPR Response Complete]
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    A --> K[PERK Activation]
    K --> L[eIF2α Phosphorylation]
    L --> M[Translation Inhibition]
    M --> N[Protein Synthesis Reduction]
    N --> J
    
    %% Regulation
    J --> O[ER Stress Status]
    O --> P{ER Stress Resolved?}
    P -->|Yes| Q[UPR Termination]
    P -->|No| R[UPR Continuation]
    
    %% Key proteins
    S[IRE1] --> C
    T[HAC1] --> E
    U[PERK] --> K
    V[eIF2α] --> L
    W[ER Chaperones] --> H
    X[UPR Genes] --> G
    
